:"\"Hey, hey, come play with us.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Twin brother. Owner and designer of White Rabbits, a clothing store."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An innocent boy with adorable behavior who charms customers with his doll-like cuteness. Slightly more active than Ferres."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"[Translated from"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142128"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/250eec68c7d42f6e11fff4351dbfc23aff3955ec897043c4b38bbea86247322e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0fec5c03ac756b0a9568e619e70d4a2e4569a3a90946ba095a4a0ee95f59f9c.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142129","characterName":"フェレス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142129"},"originalCharacterName":"フェレス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"130"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Hey, hey, come play with us.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Twin brother. Owner and designer of White Rabbits, a clothing store."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He charms customers with his doll-like cuteness. He is an innocent boy with adorable mannerisms. He is a little quieter than Mephis."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"[Translated from"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142129"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/983c33688812d9ceb37bb6651778da4a9db86122dae9d26d79908e96c6dbe9d1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2321e1ed38e53c4e2032f7fe171224705a993b3dfdfa2403d4ad97314203954.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142130","characterName":"高槻 秀則","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142130"},"originalCharacterName":"高槻 秀則","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"181"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I believe that the dead should be given the utmost respect, regardless of religion or non-religion.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Minazuki's senior at work and his boss. He is friendly and has a light-hearted demeanor at first glance, but he is enthusiastic and excellent at his work, and is highly regarded at the company."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a caring, older brother-like personality and helps out Minazuki in the areas he's weak in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"[Translated from"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142130"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/277c0abe6e4473207cdac8f61f388f6435e943b9b7675026ece0aaf87a416644.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/668bc936ee6103a7c26fcc0a0ce1af519df50c77223f7612242e1f054f8721ec.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142131","characterName":"狩屋音 悠真","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142131"},"originalCharacterName":"狩屋音 悠真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"190"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Aren't you afraid of death?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The president of \"Yukito Funeral Home\" where Minazuki works. He treats everyone with kindness and courtesy, and cares about each and every employee."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's known as a handsome and accomplished president, often featured in news and interviews."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"[Translated from"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142131"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cdefed1c693f7efd3f20126e5039646127777a6a48408cc73bf1dcb2bea0a32.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/470622ac560c58fa7aee19aa8340f4c00ba36a2e067e1e04ffe71bef3116c40d.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c142132","characterName":"新田 安寿","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c142132"},"originalCharacterName":"新田 安寿","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I've heard a lot about you from Takatsuki. You're cool, you never make mistakes, you work hard, but you also have a cute subordinate that you just can't help but feel uncomfortable around.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They are good friends and often go out drinking together. Slightly childish and small. He wears the vest outside of ceremonies in order to prioritize ease of movement."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like Takatsuki, he is an excellent employee and is highly regarded within the company. Although they are in the same year, he respects and admires Takatsuki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"[Translated from"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c142132"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://w